Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 16:32:08 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] sr-aef: write aalt's lookups out as rules

An aalt block may hold only single and alternate substitution rules and
feature references; fea-rs rejects a lookup reference there ("aalt can only
contain feature names and single or alternate sub rules"), so a font whose
aalt feature points at its lookups uncompiled to a feature file fontc could
not build. Those lookups' rules are now written into the aalt block instead.

resources/aalt.ttf is aalt.fea compiled by make_aalt.py (fontTools feaLib,
which accepts the lookup references).

Assisted by an AI agent (Claude Opus 5.5)
